    {
      "id": "6976c67af9030500047d2a28",
      "variant": "quote",
      "content": {
        "root": {
          "type": "root",
          "format": "",
          "indent": 0,
          "version": 1,
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "format": "",
              "indent": 0,
              "version": 1,
              "children": [
                {
                  "mode": "normal",
                  "text": "Chinyi's dedication comes from a belief in progressing with the times, and a promise to provide Taiwanese consumers with healthier, higher-quality egg products.",
                  "type": "text",
                  "style": "",
                  "detail": 0,
                  "format": 2,
                  "version": 1
                }
              ],
              "direction": "ltr",
              "textFormat": 0
            }
          ],
          "direction": "ltr"
        }
      },
      "author": null,
      "blockName": "Introduction Quote",
      "blockType": "highlightBox"
    },
    {
      "id": "6976c67af9030500047d2a2a",
      "blockName": "Our Beginning Part 1",
      "columns": [
        {
          "id": "6976c67af9030500047d2a29",
          "size": "full",
          "contentType": "text",
          "media": null,
          "mediaWidth": 100,
          "mediaPosition": "above",
          "richText": {
            "root": {
              "type": "root",
              "format": "",
              "indent": 0,
              "version": 1,
              "children": [
                {
                  "tag": "h3",
                  "type": "heading",
                  "format": "",
                  "indent": 0,
                  "version": 1,
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "mode": "normal",
                      "text": "Our Beginning",
                      "type": "text",
                      "style": "",
                      "detail": 0,
                      "format": 0,
                      "version": 1
                    }
                  ],
                  "direction": "ltr"
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "format": "",
                  "indent": 0,
                  "version": 1,
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "mode": "normal",
                      "text": "In the 1980s, as Taiwan's economy took off and incomes rose, consumer industries blossomed—bakeries needed eggs, food processors needed eggs, the restaurant industry needed eggs—and the market demand for egg products surged. Chicken farms could be built one after another, but whether the level of egg processing could keep pace with the market was not a given.",
                      "type": "text",
                      "style": "",
                      "detail": 0,
                      "format": 0,
                      "version": 1
                    }
                  ],
                  "direction": "ltr",
                  "textFormat": 0
                }
              ],
              "direction": "ltr"
            }
          },
          "enableLink": null,
          "link": {
            "type": "reference",
            "newTab": null,
            "url": null,
            "label": null,
            "appearance": "default"
          }
        }
      ],
      "blockType": "content"
    },
